{"chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1","number":3,"title":"Nebensätze sicher beherrschen","rows":[{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":1,"text":"Deine Satzarchitektur ist beeindruckend aber die Nebensatzhierarchie ist manchmal unklar","speaker":"Antje","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":2,"text":"Meinst du dass ich zu viele Sätze verschachtele","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":3,"text":"Genau Eine Satzreduktion würde hier helfen","speaker":"Antje","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":4,"text":"Und die Informationsstruktur sollte klarer sein","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":5,"text":"Ja Ordne die Gedanken einfach linear","speaker":"Antje","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":6,"text":"Danke Ich überarbeite das Kapitel gleich","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":1,"text":"die Satzarchitektur","voiceRole":"female","pos":"Noun · fem.","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":1,"text":"die Satzarchitektur","voiceRole":"male","pos":"Noun · fem.","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":2,"text":"die Nebensatzhierarchie","voiceRole":"female","pos":"Noun · fem.","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":2,"text":"die Nebensatzhierarchie","voiceRole":"male","pos":"Noun · fem.","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":3,"text":"verschachteln","voiceRole":"female","pos":"Verb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":3,"text":"verschachteln","voiceRole":"male","pos":"Verb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":4,"text":"die Satzreduktion","voiceRole":"female","pos":"Noun · fem.","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":4,"text":"die Satzreduktion","voiceRole":"male","pos":"Noun · fem.","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":5,"text":"die Informationsstruktur","voiceRole":"female","pos":"Noun · fem.","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":5,"text":"die Informationsstruktur","voiceRole":"male","pos":"Noun · fem.","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1"},{"section":"reading","type":"reading-passage","idx":1,"text":"Obwohl das Gericht in seiner Begründung betont dass die Meinungsfreiheit geschützt bleiben müsse sorgt das Urteil für erhebliche Kritik Kritiker bemängeln vor allem dass nicht ausreichend berücksichtigt worden sei wie stark die Betroffenen unter der Aussage gelitten hätten","authoredText":"Obwohl das Gericht in seiner Begründung betont, dass die Meinungsfreiheit geschützt bleiben müsse, sorgt das Urteil für erhebliche Kritik. Kritiker bemängeln vor allem, dass nicht ausreichend berücksichtigt worden sei, wie stark die Betroffenen unter der Aussage gelitten hätten.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Kommentar: Ein umstrittenes Urteil","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Timo, dieser Satz hier hat vier verschachtelte Nebensätze — ich verliere völlig den Faden.","speaker":"Antje","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_003_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Stimmt, ich wollte eigentlich nur einen Gedanken ausdrücken, der sich verselbstständigt hat.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C1_003_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Am besten teilen wir ihn in zwei kürzere Sätze auf.","speaker":"Antje","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_003_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Gute Idee, das liest sich bestimmt klarer.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C1_003_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1"},{"chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Timo, dieser Satz hier hat vier verschachtelte Nebensätze — ich verliere völlig den Faden.","speaker":"Antje","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_003_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Stimmt, ich wollte eigentlich nur einen Gedanken ausdrücken, der sich verselbstständigt hat.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C1_003_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Am besten teilen wir ihn in zwei kürzere Sätze auf.","speaker":"Antje","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_003_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Gute Idee, das liest sich bestimmt klarer.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C1_003_L004","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Ich würde den Satz reduzieren; ein Gedanke pro Satz trägt die Informationsstruktur besser.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1"},{"chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":1,"text":"Timo verliert bei vier verschachtelten Nebensätzen den Faden. Was rätst du?","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":2,"text":"Da die Datenlage dünn ist, verzichten wir auf eine Prognose.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1"},{"chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":2,"text":"Deine Betreuerin fragt, warum die Prognose fehlt.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":3,"text":"Ich glaube, dass die Abweichung daran liegt, dass wir zu früh gemessen haben.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1"},{"chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":3,"text":"Eine Kollegin fragt, woran die Abweichung liegt.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":4,"text":"Ich schreibe die 2024 erhobenen Daten und spare so den ganzen Relativsatz.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1"},{"chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":4,"text":"Die Lektorin sagt, der Abstract sei zwei Zeilen zu lang. Was schlägst du vor?","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":5,"text":"Obwohl die Stichprobe klein ist, lässt sich zeigen, dass der Effekt bestehen bleibt.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1"},{"chapter":"c1-03-nebensaetze-sicher-beherrschen","level":"C1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":5,"text":"Rollenspiel: Ihr überarbeitet gemeinsam einen Absatz.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false}],"controls":{"story-play-line":6,"story-play-all":1,"vword-voice-F":5,"vword-voice-M":5,"vword-listen":5,"listen-to-passage":1,"audio-play-btn":1,"hear-model":5},"surfaces":[{"n":1,"w":"Obwohl","from":"reading","type":"Konjunktion","role":"r-hierarchy"},{"n":2,"w":"das","from":"reading","type":"Article","role":"plain"